  "post_content": "<p>Aquest dijous de nit han comen&ccedil;at les festes del barri del Castellet, a Suera, amb un sopar de pa i porta, element essencial dels actes, que tamb&eacute; compten amb m&uacute;sica.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_9181.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El programa festiu que resta &eacute;s el seg&uuml;ent:</p>\n<p><strong>Divendres 26</strong><br />\n Sopar per a socis i a continuaci&oacute; actuaci&oacute; del GRUPO OMEGA.<br />\n &nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Dissabte 27</strong><br />\n Dinar al carrer<br />\n Sopar de pa i porta i a continuaci&oacute; Gran Macrodiscoteca Estils 60, 70, 80 per DJ SERAF&Iacute;N.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiafestescastelletsuera/img_9181.jpg\" alt=\"img_9181\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiafestescastelletsuera/img_9182.jpg\" alt=\"img_9182\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiafestescastelletsuera/img_9183.jpg\" alt=\"img_9183\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiafestescastelletsuera/img_9184.jpg\" alt=\"img_9184\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiafestescastelletsuera/img_9185.jpg\" alt=\"img_9185\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiafestescastelletsuera/img_9186.jpg\" alt=\"img_9186\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiafestescastelletsuera/img_9187.jpg\" alt=\"img_9187\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25df